        "",
        "",
        "ぴちょん、と冷たい雫が頬に落ち、\n私はうっすらと目を開けた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "36a436daa99dbee231d5198c5373fb9836d7f7993643701361f950397c1598ed",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "……ここ、は？　私はどうして……――ハッ！\nカティナちゃーん、ラッシーちゃーん！\nお姉ちゃんの声が聞こえるかしらぁ？",
      "jp_sha256": "0f3edca3a3702c72d72d2e99d66a2da5fe3733fb072405fb4f18c8e3b1689dfb",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "……여기는? 내가 왜……――헉!\n카티나야―, 랏시야―!\n언니 목소리 들리니이?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
